    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1354">

                <pb facs="1284" n="1118" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1118"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/898</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Jefferson
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-27T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 27, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your February 23, 3 p.m. Formation of commission by passage of law satisfactory
                    to Department. It considers that Minister of Finance, Lindberg and Paxton to be
                    third, will also be satisfactory. Commission should immediately commence its
                    labors and Paxton will leave for Managua in near future.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
